<ContentType Key="c9356982-82a2-420f-a40d-84e509c0fa28" Alias="elementLayoutHolyGrail" Level="2">
  <Info>
    <Name>Layout — Holy Grail (Nav + Main + Aside)</Name>
    <Icon>icon-sitemap color-blue</Icon>
    <Thumbnail>folder.png</Thumbnail>
    <Description><![CDATA[Layout Composer Ola 42.7 — Preset clásico "Holy Grail". Tres zonas horizontales: navegación lateral (2 cols) + contenido principal (8 cols) + rail de apoyo (2 cols). Útil para páginas que requieren nav contextual además del chrome del sitio (docs, portales admin, dashboards) más un rail secundario de CTAs/TOC. Topología: 3 areas "nav" (2 cols) + "main" (8 cols) + "aside" (2 cols). Opt-in: compDomClass + compDomVariant + compDomSpacing + compDomPresetChrome. Variations=Culture. Renderer: Views/Partials/blockgrid/Components/elementLayoutHolyGrail.cshtml. Backoffice preview: App_Plugins/LayoutComposer/views/block-layout-holy-grail.html.]]></Description>
    <AllowAtRoot>False</AllowAtRoot>
    <IsListView>False</IsListView>
    <Variations>Culture</Variations>
    <IsElement>true</IsElement>
    <HistoryCleanup>
      <PreventCleanup>False</PreventCleanup>
      <KeepAllVersionsNewerThanDays></KeepAllVersionsNewerThanDays>
      <KeepLatestVersionPerDayForDays></KeepLatestVersionPerDayForDays>
    </HistoryCleanup>
    <Folder>Elements/Layout</Folder>
